    "reviewTitle": "Sound and durability are not great.",
    "reviewDescription": "I’ve had these for about 6 weeks. Past the return timeframe unfortunately. I had very high hopes for these. I will say this, they are much more comfortable than any others I’ve tried so far. So they get 2 stars for comfort. Even with bass boost on, they are remarkably ‘tinny’. I’m not a big audiophile or anything. Just regular old music and I’m generally not too picky. The sound was noticeable even to me. The right earbud started randomly cutting out. Now if I put in just the right one it won’t even register to connect to Bluetooth. It’ll play music but I have to put the left one in first, connect and then take the left one out if I want to use just one. Range is not great either. I haven’t measured or anything, I just know what it was with my old inexpensive earbuds and these don’t come close. I regret this purchase but it’s too late to do anything about it. I’ll have to buy something else.",
